abstract: >-
  Per-brand AI answer visibility for 94 B2B SaaS brand entries (93 companies) on 50 buying questions across five G2
  categories: named counts on ChatGPT, Claude and Perplexity (manual runs, September 4 to 9, 2026; Claude and Perplexity
  recounted by hand on the answer text in v1.4), ChatGPT own-site retrieval and citation, AI Access Scores, repeated-run
  tracker figures for ChatGPT, Google Gemini and Google AI Overviews (September 7, 2026; the zero-mention test also checks
  every tracker run through September 14), per-question cross-engine source overlap, cited domains by category and summary metrics.
